WEBVTT

00:15.640 --> 00:18.470
I never dreamed before

00:18.470 --> 00:21.310
I'm gonna knock the door

00:21.310 --> 00:24.880
into the world of perfect free

00:24.880 --> 00:26.980
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:26.980 --> 00:29.820
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:29.820 --> 00:32.550
I'm gonna get the chance

00:32.550 --> 00:36.120
I thought a chance is far from me

00:36.120 --> 00:37.290
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:37.290 --> 00:40.200
I was made to hit in America

00:40.200 --> 00:43.060
(I was made to hit in America)

00:43.060 --> 00:48.970
I was made to hit in America

00:48.970 --> 00:52.640
You are the sun, you are the star

00:52.640 --> 00:54.640
(To me, forever)

00:54.640 --> 00:58.350
You are the sun, you are the star

00:58.350 --> 01:01.540
(To me, forever)

01:08.420 --> 01:14.030
I was made to hit in America

01:14.030 --> 01:16.870
I was made to hit in America

01:16.870 --> 01:19.730
(I was made to hit in America)

01:19.730 --> 01:22.540
I was made to hit in America

01:22.540 --> 01:25.310
(I was made to hit in America)

01:25.310 --> 01:32.980
I was made to hit in America

01:42.060 --> 01:46.820
We ended up at an old house
with a fishing hole.

01:50.400 --> 01:52.560
He's vicious! Watch out!

01:54.870 --> 01:56.670
C'mere!

02:01.340 --> 02:04.110
I used to have a dog.

02:04.110 --> 02:06.480
You're amazing, Izumi-chan.

02:08.850 --> 02:11.390
Hmm...

02:11.390 --> 02:14.480
First, you let him sniff your fist.

02:17.330 --> 02:21.890
And when the dog knows your scent,
you stroke it very gently.

02:23.270 --> 02:25.130
You see?

02:25.130 --> 02:27.000
'Kay.

02:27.000 --> 02:33.770
First, you let him sniff your fist...
and then stroke his head...

02:36.280 --> 02:38.250
Beck! Stop it!

02:40.450 --> 02:42.580
Yo!

02:42.580 --> 02:44.550
Beck, go play by yourself.

02:46.120 --> 02:47.850
Ryusuke-kun!

02:51.260 --> 02:54.390
Is this your house, Ryusuke-kun?

02:55.230 --> 02:59.300
Yup. As well as my workplace.

02:59.300 --> 03:01.930
It has character.

03:04.640 --> 03:10.010
Sorry, my house is old.

03:10.010 --> 03:15.780
Well...you can use it however you like.

03:15.780 --> 03:17.190
All right.

03:17.190 --> 03:21.420
-See you tomorrow.
-Bye-bye, Grandma. See ya.

03:23.890 --> 03:28.630
This place is really comfortable.

03:36.470 --> 03:39.270
You have so many CDs.

03:39.270 --> 03:43.210
-And...
-Lots of girls' romances, right?

03:43.210 --> 03:46.280
My kid sister left 'em,
and I got hooked on them.

03:46.280 --> 03:48.480
Young girls' comics?

03:48.480 --> 03:52.490
This one's good.
Christy Sakuishi's "Happy Sangokushi".

03:52.490 --> 03:55.360
Oh, I know that one!

03:55.360 --> 03:58.560
Look! Wow!

03:58.560 --> 04:02.830
This is a Dying Breed CD
from their indie days!

04:02.830 --> 04:05.800
Huh? Oh yeah...

04:05.800 --> 04:09.370
This one's worth a lot now.

04:09.370 --> 04:11.370
Oh yeah?

04:11.370 --> 04:14.680
That cover's from the band, Australia.

04:14.680 --> 04:17.710
Wow! I'd love to hear it!

04:17.710 --> 04:21.350
The original one was quite country.
Kinda like "Drag Car Boy."

04:21.350 --> 04:25.950
Oh, I have "Drag Car Boy."

04:25.950 --> 04:28.650
Eddie's totally into it.

04:43.140 --> 04:45.830
I can't follow their conversation at all.

05:08.630 --> 05:11.130
-You than before

05:11.130 --> 05:13.640
Close your eyes, no need to panic

05:13.640 --> 05:18.010
Feel the void, feel the beat,
there's no need to say it

05:18.010 --> 05:23.740
-Tomorrow will surely be wow wow

05:18.010 --> 05:23.740
-Yukio! Telephone!

05:24.580 --> 05:30.690
-So cheer up,
because I want to see your smile

05:24.580 --> 05:30.690
-Someone named Minami-san.

05:30.690 --> 05:34.250
-So cheer up,
because I want to see your smile

05:30.690 --> 05:34.250
-Minami? A man?

05:36.620 --> 05:38.290
Hello?

05:38.290 --> 05:40.730
Oh, Ryusuke-kun!

05:40.730 --> 05:44.670
Yeah. Live on Sunday, right?

05:44.670 --> 05:48.040
Yup. I'll tell Izumi-chan too.

05:48.040 --> 05:50.530
Uh-huh...Yup.

05:51.610 --> 05:55.440
I also wanna tell you something.

05:55.440 --> 05:57.750
Huh? What is it?

05:57.750 --> 06:01.280
You're 14. And I'm 16 years old.

06:01.280 --> 06:05.520
So just call me "Ryusuke".

06:05.520 --> 06:10.990
When a guy calls me "Ryusuke-kun",
it feels creepy.

06:10.990 --> 06:12.550
You listening?

06:24.770 --> 06:26.440
You think it's funny?

06:26.440 --> 06:30.080
So it's the Japanese way...
what society expects.

06:30.080 --> 06:32.880
But are you listening?

06:32.880 --> 06:38.820
I'm just not into
feudalistic practices like that.

06:38.820 --> 06:42.720
Koyuki, did you hear me?

06:42.720 --> 06:47.020
Okay. I'll call you
just Ryusuke from now on.

06:48.530 --> 06:50.930
I'll see you on Sunday.

08:14.550 --> 08:17.050
Sorry I'm late!

08:17.050 --> 08:21.820
Koyuki-san! What were you
doing at the intersection?

08:21.820 --> 08:23.620
Did you lose something?

08:29.500 --> 08:31.490
C'mon, let's go.

08:43.780 --> 08:48.680
Ryusuke-kun drew me
this map to the live house.

08:48.680 --> 08:52.450
-All simple hiragana.
-I guess he can't write kanji.

08:53.860 --> 08:55.460
Say, Izumi-chan.

08:55.460 --> 08:57.760
Hmm? What is it?

08:57.760 --> 09:01.260
Why don't you start seeing Ryusuke-kun?

09:01.260 --> 09:04.930
I mean, he's cool...

09:12.070 --> 09:16.030
Oh, right! I want you to
listen to something, Koyuki!

09:19.210 --> 09:20.620
Here it is.

09:20.620 --> 09:21.740
This.

09:25.150 --> 09:27.590
This is Dying Breed.

09:43.070 --> 09:46.110
What's the matter?

09:46.110 --> 09:47.670
This is...

09:49.540 --> 09:51.980
Oh, sorry! The battery's dead!

09:53.650 --> 09:56.050
Izumi-chan!

09:57.220 --> 10:01.320
Oh, Kayo-chan! You're late!

10:01.320 --> 10:03.050
Sorry, sorry!

10:05.360 --> 10:08.460
Dying...Breed.

10:08.460 --> 10:10.670
Koyuki, hurry it up!

10:10.670 --> 10:12.830
We'll leave you behind!

10:14.500 --> 10:16.300
This way.

10:16.300 --> 10:17.740
Hey!

10:21.480 --> 10:24.750
This is...an interesting place.

10:24.750 --> 10:28.040
-Oh, there's a good crowd.
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

10:30.790 --> 10:33.350
These are tonight's bands.

10:41.760 --> 10:43.560
What's wrong, Koyuki?

10:44.630 --> 10:46.570
A live house...

10:54.010 --> 10:55.670
Wait! That's-!

10:57.140 --> 10:58.810
Cut the crap!

11:01.020 --> 11:03.450
Can't you listen to me?!

11:04.450 --> 11:06.920
The entire band agreed to it.

11:09.790 --> 11:12.350
I like my black hair.

11:14.930 --> 11:17.260
Hey, thanks for coming.

11:17.260 --> 11:19.430
Err...Umm...

11:20.670 --> 11:22.840
Ryusuke...

11:22.840 --> 11:28.710
If you expect to be a pro,
you'd better listen to me.

11:28.710 --> 11:32.370
That white outfit
the other time was the pits.

11:34.520 --> 11:36.620
-Stop it!
-That's enough!

11:36.620 --> 11:38.750
There's a scout in the audience tonight!

11:38.750 --> 11:43.960
With any luck, we can quit our
part-time jobs and focus on our music!

11:43.960 --> 11:45.690
-Understand?!
-Eiji!

11:45.690 --> 11:47.730
-Leggo of me!
-Eiji!

11:47.730 --> 11:49.430
-Let's go.
-Yeah...

11:49.430 --> 11:50.920
Stop it!

11:53.930 --> 11:56.700
They were really going at it.

11:56.700 --> 11:59.870
They're all serious about this.
So they get uptight.

11:59.870 --> 12:02.240
It's 1500 yen, right?

12:02.240 --> 12:05.640
-Plus 500 yen for drinks.
-Here you go.

12:15.790 --> 12:21.160
-All we need is get into the night

12:15.790 --> 12:21.160
-So this is a live concert...

12:23.660 --> 12:26.800
-People need it

12:23.660 --> 12:26.800
-Wow...

12:26.800 --> 12:29.200
-get into the night

12:26.800 --> 12:29.200
-Maho...Minami.

12:29.200 --> 12:30.640
-Let it the funk

12:29.200 --> 12:30.640
-Maho...Minami.

12:30.640 --> 12:31.770
-Ain't a thing

12:30.640 --> 12:31.770
-14 years old.

12:31.770 --> 12:33.760
-All we need is

12:31.770 --> 12:33.760
-My kid sister.

12:43.980 --> 12:46.390
-Get into the night

12:46.390 --> 12:49.160
Let it the funk

12:49.160 --> 12:53.160
We got to move in the world destruction

12:53.160 --> 12:56.130
-Get in tha funky punky!

12:53.160 --> 12:56.130
-Yeah!

13:07.980 --> 13:09.510
Serial Mama.

13:09.510 --> 13:12.510
Is that the name of Ryusuke-kun's band?

13:12.510 --> 13:15.650
Yeah. Eiji-kun probably picked the name.

13:15.650 --> 13:16.780
Serial Mama...

13:16.780 --> 13:21.420
A year ago, Eiji-kun said he was
gonna make the ultimate band.

13:21.420 --> 13:22.820
-The "ultimate band"?
-The "ultimate band"?

13:22.820 --> 13:26.990
Apparently, he really bugged
Ryusuke-kun about joining.

13:26.990 --> 13:30.160
Say Kayo-chan...Is that him?

13:30.160 --> 13:35.500
Oh yeah, from the production company.
Eiji-kun's friend brought him.

13:35.500 --> 13:39.110
If things go well, a major debut
may no longer be just a dream.

13:39.110 --> 13:42.140
-What do you think?
-Looks good.

13:42.140 --> 13:45.050
I wonder if those two are okay.

13:45.050 --> 13:48.450
I know! It's like they have two leaders,

13:48.450 --> 13:50.250
and it's nerve-wracking just watching them.

13:50.250 --> 13:52.150
Don't worry about 'em.

13:53.290 --> 13:57.960
Two opposites with perfect techniques
combine to create that sound!

13:57.960 --> 14:01.760
Those two lead guitars...
Man, talk about music!

14:01.760 --> 14:05.460
Serial Mama...They are the best!

14:08.400 --> 14:10.140
Oh, they're up.

14:10.140 --> 14:11.970
Let's go up closer!

14:36.100 --> 14:37.530
Yay!

14:37.530 --> 14:41.160
Eiji! I love you!

14:47.710 --> 14:49.210
Yahoo!

14:49.210 --> 14:52.110
We're the Serial Mama!

15:01.390 --> 15:03.820
Hey! That's weird!

15:03.820 --> 15:08.090
Sorry about that!
We'll get it fixed, just a sec!

15:09.960 --> 15:14.470
Hmm...Let's use this time
for some chit-chat!

15:14.470 --> 15:16.370
Eiji, can I tell them that?

15:16.370 --> 15:21.410
Boy, that was a shock.
Does this happen often?

15:21.410 --> 15:25.680
A guitar string will break sometimes.

15:25.680 --> 15:29.520
But something this bad never happens.

15:29.520 --> 15:31.850
What a day for it to happen...

15:39.360 --> 15:42.300
Can you connect the guitar line to C1?

15:42.300 --> 15:45.130
Got it!

15:45.130 --> 15:47.770
My shield is fine.

15:47.770 --> 15:50.300
Not mine. It's broken.

15:50.300 --> 15:53.210
I'll switch it!

15:53.210 --> 15:59.370
-How long's it gonna take?!
-Hurry it up!

16:03.480 --> 16:07.390
I got it. The effecter volume was too low.

16:07.390 --> 16:08.980
Eiji!

16:09.960 --> 16:12.620
Yo! I'm okay on my side!

16:18.770 --> 16:22.860
Thank you for your patience! Let's go!

16:33.250 --> 16:36.410
You're the best!

16:41.260 --> 16:42.690
Huh?

17:07.950 --> 17:10.220
They're having a wrap party
at a pub up the street.

17:10.220 --> 17:13.020
-Won't you join us, Koyuki?
-Yeah.

17:13.020 --> 17:15.550
Hey, Izumi-chan, are your ears okay?

17:16.760 --> 17:19.960
Oh, that's right. It was your
first time at a live concert.

17:19.960 --> 17:23.860
Don't worry. Your hearing
will return in a bit.

17:23.860 --> 17:25.700
I'm going to call home.

17:25.700 --> 17:27.500
We'll go on ahead.

17:27.500 --> 17:28.070
"Pub New Shinshu"

17:28.070 --> 17:30.970
"Pub New Shinshu"

17:28.070 --> 17:30.970
-Okay, three orders of chuhai.
-Hey, gimme some beef tongue.

17:30.970 --> 17:34.840
"Pub New Shinshu"

17:30.970 --> 17:34.840
Hey, Eiji-kun and Ryusuke haven't
exchanged a word since the fight.

17:34.840 --> 17:36.910
Hey, Eiji-kun and Ryusuke haven't
exchanged a word since the fight.

17:36.910 --> 17:41.140
Geez...This band is really in trouble.

17:43.550 --> 17:47.020
What are you saying, girl?!

17:47.020 --> 17:51.360
The Eiji and Ryusuke duo
will be together forever!

17:52.930 --> 17:54.550
I'm going to the john.

17:56.330 --> 17:58.260
This is the pits!

18:10.140 --> 18:15.240
Say, this is the toilet, right?

18:16.220 --> 18:19.340
Oh, you're Ryusuke-kun's younger sister.

18:20.820 --> 18:25.160
-Is this the toilet?
-Yeah, I think so.

18:25.160 --> 18:26.130
Thanks.

18:26.130 --> 18:30.630
Oh, I see. Maho-chan,
you're not good with kanji either.

18:30.630 --> 18:32.570
What?!

18:32.570 --> 18:35.130
Who the fuck are you?!

18:38.940 --> 18:40.200
Idiot.

18:41.210 --> 18:43.480
Dammit!

18:43.480 --> 18:50.420
-You wench!
-You got Serial Mama all wrong!

18:50.420 --> 18:52.590
Where's the sake?! Bring the sake!

18:52.590 --> 18:55.750
-Shut up!
-Screw you!

19:02.030 --> 19:04.630
Pankration began in ancient Greece,

19:04.630 --> 19:07.870
and in modern England, it became
popular as the Lancashire style

19:07.870 --> 19:10.600
and was adapted into what
we know today as free-style wrestling.

19:10.600 --> 19:13.540
And many wrestlers
have come up the ranks

19:13.540 --> 19:15.880
after going through
the notorious Snake Pit.

19:15.880 --> 19:18.280
And famous among them is Karl Gotch.

19:20.310 --> 19:24.590
-Want to listen to this?
-Can I borrow it?

19:24.590 --> 19:26.790
Of course!

19:26.790 --> 19:29.360
Ryusuke-kun is really something.

19:29.360 --> 19:30.920
Yeah.

19:30.920 --> 19:34.290
I hope you find something
to get passionate about, too.

19:34.290 --> 19:35.400
Yeah.

19:35.400 --> 19:38.200
You can give it back anytime.

19:38.200 --> 19:40.930
See you!

19:40.930 --> 19:42.230
Thanks!

19:44.270 --> 19:49.040
I think Ishiguro-sempai
may have a thing for you.

19:49.040 --> 19:51.840
-I don't think so...
-Neither do I.

20:01.360 --> 20:05.460
Say, Ishiguro. You've been
awfully cheerful lately.

20:05.460 --> 20:07.290
You think so?

20:07.290 --> 20:08.920
I'm suspicious!

21:15.700 --> 21:19.830
It was a mistake. You and me joining up.

21:27.640 --> 21:29.010
Yes?

21:29.010 --> 21:31.030
No, it's all right.

21:32.050 --> 21:34.450
Yes, I'll be right there!

21:34.450 --> 21:36.580
Yes, thank you!

21:38.290 --> 21:41.050
It's the weekend,
and I can't even take off!

21:41.050 --> 21:42.650
Hard luck.

21:43.790 --> 21:48.300
You wouldn't understand
what I have to go through.

21:48.300 --> 21:51.630
Not you, a CEO's son.

22:03.810 --> 22:05.680
Ryusuke...

22:05.680 --> 22:09.310
I'm going to form the ultimate band.

22:15.420 --> 22:17.080
So will I.

22:34.340 --> 22:36.280
Ryusuke-kun...

22:50.350 --> 22:52.460
Another minute

22:52.460 --> 22:55.430
Feelin' so fine

22:57.460 --> 22:59.700
You turn the freeze

22:59.700 --> 23:02.360
into warm light

23:04.530 --> 23:08.110
Had a premonition

23:08.110 --> 23:10.810
I've been waitin' ever since

23:10.810 --> 23:14.310
My world comin' down

23:14.310 --> 23:16.940
It's got me spinnin' 'round

23:18.880 --> 23:25.220
If you really wanna fly

23:25.220 --> 23:28.090
you gotta let go

23:40.070 --> 23:42.410
Simply the most

23:42.410 --> 23:44.440
big sensation

23:44.440 --> 23:47.240
(once you're here you won't go back)

23:47.240 --> 23:49.510
She's really pretty

23:49.510 --> 23:51.850
One-eyed vision

23:51.850 --> 23:54.350
(lose the fear it don't come back)

23:54.350 --> 23:58.020
Little sister showed me

23:58.020 --> 24:00.660
Really took me for a ride

24:00.660 --> 24:02.260
My world comin' down

24:02.260 --> 24:05.730
(once you're here you won't go back)

24:05.730 --> 24:09.500
(lose the fear it don't come back)

24:13.800 --> 24:16.270
Lately, I'm really into the love game!

24:16.270 --> 24:16.810
"Next Episode"

24:16.270 --> 24:16.810
Lately, I'm really into the love game!

24:16.810 --> 24:18.210
"Next Episode"

24:18.210 --> 24:19.640
"Next Episode"

24:18.210 --> 24:19.640
Just kidding.

24:19.640 --> 24:20.200
"Next Episode"
